WEBVTT

00:00:04.670 --> 00:00:06.840
It's finally summer vacation!

00:00:08.420 --> 00:00:10.470
That's a happy occasion, but...

00:00:10.920 --> 00:00:12.470
Potted morning glories...

00:00:13.130 --> 00:00:15.600
A swimsuit bag and lunch bag...

00:00:16.180 --> 00:00:17.970
Are you an elementary school student?

00:00:17.970 --> 00:00:22.810
Oh, your jab makes it worth
lugging them home!

00:00:23.060 --> 00:00:25.730
Tama, is that why you're doing it?

00:00:25.940 --> 00:00:27.020
You've got a lot of energy.

00:00:27.770 --> 00:00:30.030
After all, we're on summer vacation now!

00:00:30.280 --> 00:00:33.110
How could you not be happy?

00:00:33.780 --> 00:00:34.990
I am happy.

00:00:35.780 --> 00:00:40.370
But we won't get to see
each other much during the break.

00:00:43.540 --> 00:00:45.460
Hana, are you hungry?

00:00:45.710 --> 00:00:47.170
Does your tummy hurt?

00:00:47.170 --> 00:00:49.340
S-Sorry. I'm fine.

00:00:49.590 --> 00:00:51.970
I just felt lonely all of a sudden.

00:00:52.880 --> 00:00:54.760
We're so loved!

00:00:55.010 --> 00:00:56.680
We're loved.

00:00:57.100 --> 00:00:58.100
Love.

00:01:00.270 --> 00:01:03.850
Don't worry. We made plenty of plans
to see each other, didn't we?

00:01:04.230 --> 00:01:05.350
Yeah!

00:01:05.600 --> 00:01:08.520
Like the summer festival
at the shrine tomorrow!

00:01:09.020 --> 00:01:10.730
Th-That's right!

00:01:11.070 --> 00:01:13.450
Why don't we all go in yukatas?

00:01:14.280 --> 00:01:16.240
I'll help you put it on!

00:01:16.570 --> 00:01:19.740
That'll be a big help!
Hana, do you have a yukata?

00:01:20.120 --> 00:01:21.200
Yukata...

00:01:22.200 --> 00:01:23.080
Yeah!

00:01:23.330 --> 00:01:24.160
I have one!

00:01:24.410 --> 00:01:28.920
Then bring your yukatas
over to my castle tomorrow!

00:01:29.250 --> 00:01:31.000
- Okay!
- I'm gonna invade!

00:01:32.300 --> 00:01:33.300
<i>I see.</i>

00:01:33.670 --> 00:01:36.180
<i>Even without school,
we can have a lot of fun together!</i>

00:03:12.480 --> 00:03:16.480
TOMATO FESTIVAL

00:03:12.940 --> 00:03:14.360
It's good, huh?

00:03:14.610 --> 00:03:17.490
It moisturizes a dried-out body.

00:03:18.150 --> 00:03:20.110
You look kind of tired recently.

00:03:20.610 --> 00:03:22.240
Is it tough studying?

00:03:23.410 --> 00:03:25.200
No problem there.

00:03:25.660 --> 00:03:26.790
No problem?

00:03:27.450 --> 00:03:31.210
The summer course
at the prep school starts soon.

00:03:32.000 --> 00:03:37.920
So when I think about joining a batch
of shiny, youthful high school students...

00:03:38.420 --> 00:03:41.010
So that's what's got you stressed out.

00:03:41.300 --> 00:03:46.720
When high school student luminaries
get close, how should I handle it?

00:03:46.970 --> 00:03:49.640
I've been running simulations all this time,

00:03:50.440 --> 00:03:54.270
but there aren't any hiding places
in the prep school, so I'm stumped.

00:03:54.520 --> 00:03:56.400
Is it necessary to hide?

00:03:57.320 --> 00:03:58.320
I've got it!

00:03:58.570 --> 00:04:01.400
Ms. Hannen, why don't we go
to the summer festival together?

00:04:02.070 --> 00:04:03.280
Summer festival?

00:04:03.870 --> 00:04:08.040
There'll be so many shiny people at the fest
that prep school will be like nothing!

00:04:08.290 --> 00:04:10.120
So think of it as a dry run!

00:04:10.370 --> 00:04:11.250
That makes sense!

00:04:11.500 --> 00:04:14.000
Fight fire with fire, right?

00:04:14.580 --> 00:04:15.790
It'll be fun.

00:04:16.130 --> 00:04:18.670
It'll be good virtual training!

00:04:19.050 --> 00:04:21.930
I'll prepare a yukata for you.

00:04:21.930 --> 00:04:24.010
I see! Camouflage, huh?

00:04:24.260 --> 00:04:26.890
Please don't hide or I'll lose sight of you!

00:04:28.970 --> 00:04:31.690
Um, I'm sure it was right here.

00:04:31.980 --> 00:04:33.060
There!

00:04:42.030 --> 00:04:43.700
<i>You're going to bring
your yukata, aren't you?</i>

00:04:44.910 --> 00:04:47.700
<i>I don't need it.
I won't have a chance to wear it.</i>

00:04:48.030 --> 00:04:49.830
<i>I bet you will.</i>

00:04:50.200 --> 00:04:51.330
<i>It'll be fine.</i>

00:04:51.330 --> 00:04:53.670
<i>Shion can help you put it on.</i>

00:04:58.800 --> 00:05:00.260
I wonder if it looks good on me.

00:05:09.180 --> 00:05:13.640
Wahoo! Welcome to the station
nearest to my castle!

00:05:14.020 --> 00:05:15.940
You're even hyper in the morning?

00:05:16.190 --> 00:05:17.810
Can you keep it up until the festival?

00:05:17.810 --> 00:05:19.520
I'll show you that I can maintain it!

00:05:19.520 --> 00:05:21.690
G-Good morning, Tama.

00:05:21.690 --> 00:05:24.610
You must be tired from carrying all that.

00:05:25.160 --> 00:05:27.490
How about a plum to relieve your fatigue?

00:05:28.370 --> 00:05:29.490
Thank you!

00:05:30.120 --> 00:05:31.200
Me, too!

00:05:31.410 --> 00:05:32.700
Here you go! Here you go!

00:05:33.870 --> 00:05:35.210
Sour!

00:05:36.120 --> 00:05:37.080
That woke me up.

00:05:37.330 --> 00:05:38.750
It's really good!

00:05:39.670 --> 00:05:41.590
I pickled it myself.

00:05:42.590 --> 00:05:44.380
You're a jill of many trades, Tama!

00:05:44.380 --> 00:05:46.380
MOMOCHI

00:05:45.590 --> 00:05:48.640
Wow! A traditional Japanese-style house!

00:05:49.100 --> 00:05:50.560
It's Japanese style... Wafu...

00:05:50.560 --> 00:05:51.640
Wahoo.

00:05:51.890 --> 00:05:52.850
Wahoo!

00:05:53.100 --> 00:05:54.270
Wahoo!

00:05:54.890 --> 00:05:56.390
Wahoo!

00:05:56.640 --> 00:05:58.560
W-Wahoo!

00:06:00.020 --> 00:06:01.480
I'm back!

00:06:01.860 --> 00:06:03.650
Welcome home, Tama.

00:06:03.900 --> 00:06:06.610
And Tama's friends, welcome.

00:06:06.860 --> 00:06:09.200
Nice to meet you. I'm Eiko Tokura.

00:06:09.910 --> 00:06:12.450
Tama's a good friend.

00:06:13.290 --> 00:06:15.870
I'm Kamuri Sengoku.

00:06:16.120 --> 00:06:20.710
H-Hello! I'm Hana Ichinose!
Nice to meet you!

00:06:21.880 --> 00:06:24.340
It's a pleasure to meet all of you.

00:06:24.760 --> 00:06:26.720
They're all cute girls, aren't they?

00:06:27.010 --> 00:06:27.970
They sure are!

00:06:28.260 --> 00:06:29.970
I know, right?

00:06:30.220 --> 00:06:32.930
All of my friends are adorable!

00:06:33.220 --> 00:06:34.930
We're the cream of the crop.

00:06:35.560 --> 00:06:36.850
If you do say so yourself?

00:06:37.190 --> 00:06:40.360
Tama, you're going to leave your things
here and then go shopping, right?

00:06:40.650 --> 00:06:42.320
Huh? Are we?

00:06:43.400 --> 00:06:46.190
Will you come with me?

00:07:04.340 --> 00:07:06.420
Is there a supermarket near here?

00:07:07.550 --> 00:07:09.930
I guess you'd call it an "indie greengrocer."

00:07:10.590 --> 00:07:11.970
Indie?

00:07:13.760 --> 00:07:14.560
Ta-da!

00:07:14.560 --> 00:07:18.020
TORETATE VEGETABLE FARM
FRESHLY PICKED VEGETABLES

00:07:14.930 --> 00:07:16.020
Here it is!

00:07:16.890 --> 00:07:18.020
A direct sales place!

00:07:18.390 --> 00:07:19.270
It looks good.

00:07:19.520 --> 00:07:21.350
Kamu, you're too close.

00:07:22.690 --> 00:07:24.440
Everything does look good!

00:07:24.980 --> 00:07:26.740
Tama, good morning!

00:07:26.990 --> 00:07:29.530
Hey, good morning!

00:07:29.780 --> 00:07:31.660
I'll take a basket of tomatoes!

00:07:31.910 --> 00:07:34.830
Sure thing. I'll throw in
a few as a bonus, too.

00:07:35.290 --> 00:07:37.080
Thank you!

00:07:41.670 --> 00:07:44.090
- Want to eat one here?
- Yep, yep.

00:07:44.590 --> 00:07:46.920
You can use the sink.

00:07:47.260 --> 00:07:49.130
It's shiny!

00:07:50.840 --> 00:07:52.840
What is this? It's so sweet!

00:07:54.640 --> 00:07:55.600
Delicious.

00:07:55.850 --> 00:07:58.430
Yeah, right? That's because
they're freshly picked!

00:07:58.680 --> 00:08:01.310
And it feels good
getting to eat it outside.

00:08:01.520 --> 00:08:03.650
It's like a feeling of freedom!

00:08:06.480 --> 00:08:10.070
Hana, yikes!
Your white outfit is gonna stain!

00:08:11.650 --> 00:08:13.910
Look, this way it won't spill on you!

00:08:16.870 --> 00:08:18.500
Yeah, this catches everything.

00:08:18.750 --> 00:08:19.830
I know, right?

00:08:20.120 --> 00:08:23.290
But there's no feeling of freedom this way!

00:08:23.880 --> 00:08:25.340
I know, right?

00:08:25.590 --> 00:08:28.920
How can you guys eat
without making a mess?

00:08:29.760 --> 00:08:32.680
I guess as I bite into it,
I suck up the juice.

00:08:32.930 --> 00:08:34.930
Chomp and slurp!

00:08:35.180 --> 00:08:36.680
Yeah, like that.

00:08:37.140 --> 00:08:38.180
Free of any other thoughts.

00:08:38.470 --> 00:08:40.430
A-All right!

00:08:44.190 --> 00:08:47.270
We're like if the Three Wise Men
were the Three Stooges.

00:08:47.570 --> 00:08:48.690
What does that mean?

00:08:51.360 --> 00:08:52.700
Acqua pazza!

00:08:53.280 --> 00:08:54.610
It's like a restaurant!

00:08:54.860 --> 00:08:55.700
Another helping!

00:08:55.950 --> 00:08:57.780
You haven't eaten the first one yet.

00:08:59.120 --> 00:09:00.870
Thank you for the meal!

00:09:02.040 --> 00:09:03.250
Delicious!

00:09:03.250 --> 00:09:04.370
This is really good!

00:09:05.080 --> 00:09:05.960
Another helping.

00:09:06.420 --> 00:09:07.710
A-Are you sure?

00:09:07.920 --> 00:09:10.460
- The festival's in the evening!
- Plenty of time.

00:09:10.840 --> 00:09:12.420
That's our Kamu!

00:09:12.630 --> 00:09:14.930
All of you, fill up!

00:09:15.510 --> 00:09:17.720
It's so delicious
that I'm gonna eat too much.

00:09:17.970 --> 00:09:19.760
I may not be able to tie my yukata closed.

00:09:20.020 --> 00:09:21.270
I know!

00:09:21.520 --> 00:09:23.730
Oh, Tama!

00:09:24.600 --> 00:09:27.980
To be honest, I was going to boil
the fish in soy sauce,

00:09:28.230 --> 00:09:30.940
but the vegetable seller
gave me so many free tomatoes

00:09:31.280 --> 00:09:34.240
that I tried an Italian dish!

00:09:34.240 --> 00:09:35.070
Buono!

00:09:36.240 --> 00:09:39.160
You suddenly changed the menu
and made something this incredible?

00:09:39.160 --> 00:09:40.580
You're amazing, Tama!

00:09:41.120 --> 00:09:43.160
Tama is amazing.

00:09:43.410 --> 00:09:45.620
She's good at cooking
and doing it on a budget.

00:09:45.870 --> 00:09:49.750
Speaking of cooking, remember that time
Tama was in elementary school?

00:09:49.750 --> 00:09:53.050
Yes, that was hilarious! Listen...

00:09:54.800 --> 00:09:59.470
I thought this was my castle,
but it's really enemy territory!

00:10:02.220 --> 00:10:03.980
If you use two cords around the waist,

00:10:04.180 --> 00:10:06.140
it's easier to adjust the bottom.

00:10:06.140 --> 00:10:08.480
I see. I'm learning a lot here!

00:10:08.860 --> 00:10:12.860
Yukatas and kimonos look better
when you flatten out your body.

00:10:13.110 --> 00:10:15.200
So that's why a towel
is wrapped around the chest, huh?

00:10:15.200 --> 00:10:16.030
That's right.

00:10:16.530 --> 00:10:19.870
In other words, I don't need this towel.

00:10:20.120 --> 00:10:20.990
Tama,

00:10:21.370 --> 00:10:23.750
you're not done growing yet.

00:10:26.460 --> 00:10:27.290
Here you go.

00:10:27.540 --> 00:10:29.000
Thank you, Eiko.

00:10:29.540 --> 00:10:32.670
Tama was right.
You really are considerate.

00:10:32.920 --> 00:10:35.380
Oh, is that what you said about me?

00:10:36.930 --> 00:10:39.640
A-After all, it's true, isn't it?

00:10:40.100 --> 00:10:43.890
She always says
how cute you are, Kamuri.

00:10:44.930 --> 00:10:48.900
Let Tama hold you in her arms
once in a while, Kamuri.

00:10:50.270 --> 00:10:53.440
When what I say in the privacy
of my home gets blurted out,

00:10:53.690 --> 00:10:55.860
of course I'm going to be embarrassed!

00:10:56.360 --> 00:10:59.360
<i>I wonder what she says
about me at home.</i>

00:10:59.950 --> 00:11:01.620
- Hana...
- Y-Yes?

00:11:01.990 --> 00:11:04.540
We hear you're a really funny girl.

00:11:04.790 --> 00:11:05.580
Funny?

00:11:05.830 --> 00:11:07.540
- I know what she means.
- You know what that means?

00:11:07.910 --> 00:11:10.750
You're cute and funny, Hana!

00:11:11.920 --> 00:11:12.880
Also...

00:11:14.050 --> 00:11:16.260
she says you're very kind.

00:11:19.380 --> 00:11:20.550
Grandma!

00:11:20.800 --> 00:11:22.550
Oh, I shouldn't have told them?

00:11:23.010 --> 00:11:25.180
I-It wasn't wrong!

00:11:25.430 --> 00:11:29.100
But it's like a dating sim where
the character's favorability rating goes up

00:11:29.100 --> 00:11:31.440
after positive rumors spread about them!

00:11:31.900 --> 00:11:33.860
Tama, I don't understand the reference.

00:11:33.860 --> 00:11:34.860
What?

00:11:35.110 --> 00:11:35.940
Hana...

00:11:36.570 --> 00:11:37.820
Your face is melting.

00:11:45.950 --> 00:11:48.660
Summer festival!

00:11:49.210 --> 00:11:51.290
It's the summer festival!

00:11:51.620 --> 00:11:53.880
She's even more hyper.

00:11:54.130 --> 00:11:55.960
The sky's the limit!

00:11:56.130 --> 00:11:58.670
Takoyaki, yakisoba, grilled corn...

00:11:58.670 --> 00:12:00.970
It's like Kamu's casting a spell.

00:12:01.760 --> 00:12:03.510
Let's go, everyone!

00:12:03.760 --> 00:12:05.140
Move out!

00:12:05.390 --> 00:12:06.640
- Yeah!
- Yeah!

00:12:06.640 --> 00:12:08.350
Y-Yeah!

00:12:23.740 --> 00:12:26.080
A-Am I doing a good job
camouflaging myself?

00:12:29.540 --> 00:12:32.080
The yukata looks really good on you.

00:12:32.370 --> 00:12:34.960
Th-Thank you!

00:12:35.840 --> 00:12:38.090
I thought I'd never put on a yukata

00:12:38.550 --> 00:12:41.220
and come to a summer festival.

00:12:41.550 --> 00:12:42.760
Ms. Hannen...

00:12:43.010 --> 00:12:45.850
I was terrified until we actually got here,

00:12:46.430 --> 00:12:50.600
but this atmosphere makes me feel
like an excited kid again!

00:12:52.230 --> 00:12:53.810
Let's have a good time tonight!

00:12:54.060 --> 00:12:56.150
It's important to have
a change of pace once in a while.

00:12:56.150 --> 00:12:56.980
Right!

00:12:56.980 --> 00:13:00.860
Oh, that's right! Since we're here,
let's pray for your school success!

00:13:01.820 --> 00:13:03.610
We'll get a god on our side.

00:13:04.200 --> 00:13:05.620
That's reassuring, isn't it?

00:13:05.950 --> 00:13:07.120
Landlady...

00:13:07.490 --> 00:13:08.330
Yes!

00:13:08.740 --> 00:13:10.500
TAKOYAKI

00:13:12.660 --> 00:13:14.000
You look like a hamster!

00:13:14.250 --> 00:13:15.500
That's cute!

00:13:15.880 --> 00:13:21.460
Ham-uri has two piping hot takoyaki
in her mouth, but is totally fine!

00:13:22.170 --> 00:13:24.010
Now that you mention it...

00:13:24.260 --> 00:13:26.140
You're tough, Ham-uri!

00:13:26.390 --> 00:13:27.720
I have cheeks of steel.

00:13:27.720 --> 00:13:28.930
Hey!

00:13:29.310 --> 00:13:31.850
Amane, Maho!
I didn't know you guys were here.

00:13:32.520 --> 00:13:33.810
You guys are wearing yukatas!

00:13:34.270 --> 00:13:35.350
Lucky!

00:13:35.600 --> 00:13:38.570
We just came here after club.

00:13:38.820 --> 00:13:39.570
I see.

00:13:39.820 --> 00:13:42.650
So you have track and field practice
even during summer break?

00:13:42.650 --> 00:13:43.450
Yep!

00:13:43.900 --> 00:13:45.820
So come over and check us out anytime!

00:13:46.280 --> 00:13:49.450
We're looking for a manager,
too, Ms. Ichinose!

00:13:49.450 --> 00:13:50.950
I mean, Hana!

00:13:51.950 --> 00:13:54.160
Watch out or they'll try to rope you in.

00:13:54.160 --> 00:13:56.580
Well, we don't have many members.

00:13:57.750 --> 00:14:00.090
You're adorable in a yukata, Kamuri!

00:14:00.590 --> 00:14:01.960
Can I pick you up?

00:14:02.210 --> 00:14:04.510
Don't worry, I took a shower after running!

00:14:04.510 --> 00:14:05.840
N-No.

00:14:07.300 --> 00:14:08.510
She said no.

00:14:08.850 --> 00:14:10.350
No, huh?

00:14:10.600 --> 00:14:12.350
Why do you still look happy?

00:14:19.400 --> 00:14:20.270
I did it!

00:14:20.820 --> 00:14:22.280
I did it, Landlady!

00:14:22.530 --> 00:14:25.150
I opened up a hole clean through its guts!

00:14:25.530 --> 00:14:28.110
Can you try the stuffed animal
next to it, too?

00:14:29.240 --> 00:14:30.620
Leave it to me!

00:14:31.530 --> 00:14:32.540
Banpi!

00:14:32.540 --> 00:14:33.370
Tama!

00:14:33.620 --> 00:14:35.120
Yay!

00:14:36.210 --> 00:14:41.750
Hey, the mini sunflowers are almost
in full bloom, so come see them next time.

00:14:42.340 --> 00:14:43.710
O-Of course!

00:14:44.800 --> 00:14:46.880
That brooch is cute.

00:14:47.630 --> 00:14:49.930
It suits you, Ms. Ichinose.

00:14:51.470 --> 00:14:52.720
Thank you.

00:15:03.070 --> 00:15:06.070
I'm about ready for some recreation!

00:15:06.570 --> 00:15:07.780
Recreation?

00:15:08.030 --> 00:15:10.410
But before fishing for goldfish
and target practice,

00:15:10.410 --> 00:15:13.330
we'll do the long-awaited dessert time!

00:15:13.580 --> 00:15:15.370
I'm talking sweets!

00:15:15.950 --> 00:15:17.580
That sounds really sweet.

00:15:17.830 --> 00:15:19.120
Tama's a schemer.

00:15:19.370 --> 00:15:21.500
Please call me a "master tactician"!

00:15:23.380 --> 00:15:24.590
Kei, Sachi...

00:15:25.090 --> 00:15:26.090
Are you okay?

00:15:26.420 --> 00:15:27.880
Eiko...

00:15:28.260 --> 00:15:31.140
Tsubaki's sandal strap broke.

00:15:31.390 --> 00:15:34.260
Chihiro's out buying her
another pair of sandals now, but...

00:15:35.140 --> 00:15:37.140
Are you all right? Are you hurt?

00:15:39.060 --> 00:15:40.270
Thanks.

00:15:45.280 --> 00:15:46.320
Ta-da!

00:15:46.570 --> 00:15:48.450
A temporary repair!

00:15:49.900 --> 00:15:53.410
Sorry, I did it with my handkerchief, but here!

00:15:53.700 --> 00:15:55.660
But I don't want to get
your handkerchief dirty.

00:15:56.040 --> 00:15:57.660
Don't worry about it!

00:15:58.200 --> 00:16:00.420
I brought it for a time like this!

00:16:00.750 --> 00:16:02.000
I-I'm okay.

00:16:02.000 --> 00:16:02.960
But...

00:16:03.210 --> 00:16:04.380
No, thank you.

00:16:04.790 --> 00:16:06.210
Oh... Right.

00:16:12.800 --> 00:16:13.890
Teacher!

00:16:15.560 --> 00:16:16.510
You guys?

00:16:16.850 --> 00:16:21.350
I'm not surprised you came here
to have some fun, too, Ms. Enami!

00:16:21.730 --> 00:16:23.860
This isn't fun. It's work.

00:16:24.480 --> 00:16:28.530
For local events like this,
teachers are on patrol.

00:16:28.940 --> 00:16:31.110
Are you on patrol by yourself, Teacher?

00:16:31.910 --> 00:16:36.030
I was with the head teacher,
but I pretended to get lost and ditched her.

00:16:36.870 --> 00:16:39.500
Stuff like that is why she gets mad at you.

00:16:40.120 --> 00:16:41.250
Shut up.

00:16:41.710 --> 00:16:45.500
But you should've worn a yukata.

00:16:45.750 --> 00:16:47.630
I told you, this is work.

00:16:47.960 --> 00:16:52.090
You guys haven't let loose and gotten
in mischief because this is a festival, right?

00:16:52.340 --> 00:16:53.260
Mischief?

00:16:53.760 --> 00:16:58.850
Like release eastern cicadas into
western Japan, and destroy an ecosystem.

00:16:58.850 --> 00:17:02.190
Or use up all of a person's
gold origami papers.

00:17:02.440 --> 00:17:03.650
That's pure evil.

00:17:04.310 --> 00:17:05.360
Come on, Teacher.

00:17:05.900 --> 00:17:06.980
Have a bite.

00:17:14.530 --> 00:17:15.700
Is it good?

00:17:16.200 --> 00:17:18.700
A high school girl who feeds the teacher...

00:17:19.160 --> 00:17:21.500
It tastes like soft ice cream.

00:17:22.000 --> 00:17:23.870
Well, it is soft ice cream.

00:17:24.790 --> 00:17:25.580
Teacher,

00:17:25.920 --> 00:17:27.090
you have some on your lip.

00:17:32.720 --> 00:17:34.180
Sorry. It was on impulse.

00:17:36.430 --> 00:17:38.010
That was hot!

00:17:38.260 --> 00:17:40.310
Wh-What just happened?

00:18:16.760 --> 00:18:18.260
What do you wanna do now?

00:18:19.100 --> 00:18:22.470
Why don't we set off the fireworks
I won in that drawing?

00:18:27.230 --> 00:18:30.730
Thank you so much
for this evening, Landlady.

00:18:31.070 --> 00:18:33.030
Was it a nice change of pace for you?

00:18:33.320 --> 00:18:35.150
Yes, very much!

00:18:36.150 --> 00:18:38.660
SCHOOL SUCCESS

00:18:36.950 --> 00:18:38.660
At a time like this,

00:18:38.660 --> 00:18:42.910
I feel like you and Hana
are constantly supporting me.

00:18:43.910 --> 00:18:44.870
I swear I'll pay you back...

00:18:46.000 --> 00:18:49.960
by never being late or absent
for my summer course!

00:18:50.210 --> 00:18:53.210
I'm not afraid of any shiny, youthful kids!

00:19:04.930 --> 00:19:07.100
It's been a long time
since I've done fireworks!

00:19:07.310 --> 00:19:08.270
Me, too!

00:19:08.520 --> 00:19:11.270
It's been a long, long time for me!

00:19:13.360 --> 00:19:14.860
I'm afraid of ghosts!

00:19:14.860 --> 00:19:18.450
W-We prayed before,
so we should be good!

00:19:19.200 --> 00:19:21.030
This is a kind of sparkler.

00:19:23.580 --> 00:19:27.290
What did you guys wish for
at the shrine?

00:19:27.290 --> 00:19:28.120
How about you?

00:19:29.080 --> 00:19:33.960
For world peace, for the price
of vegetables not to go up,

00:19:34.250 --> 00:19:39.300
for me to win concert tickets,
and for us to continue having fun together!

00:19:39.550 --> 00:19:40.800
That's a lot.

00:19:41.220 --> 00:19:43.930
So what did you wish for, Eiko?

00:19:44.220 --> 00:19:45.220
It's a secret.

00:19:45.470 --> 00:19:48.230
After all, if you say it,
it supposedly won't come true.

00:19:49.440 --> 00:19:52.110
Gods aren't that petty!

00:19:52.360 --> 00:19:53.980
Then, mine is a secret, too.

00:19:55.230 --> 00:19:59.030
H-How about you, Hana?
You'll share yours, won't you?

00:19:59.530 --> 00:20:00.320
Yeah.

00:20:00.990 --> 00:20:04.410
But I didn't really make a wish.

00:20:04.870 --> 00:20:05.910
You didn't?

00:20:06.330 --> 00:20:07.330
Free of desire?

00:20:07.660 --> 00:20:08.660
I gave thanks.

00:20:09.250 --> 00:20:11.170
I said, "Thank you."

00:20:12.630 --> 00:20:16.130
Because every day at school has been fun

00:20:16.710 --> 00:20:18.630
since I became friends with you guys!

00:20:20.260 --> 00:20:21.340
Hana...

00:20:22.890 --> 00:20:24.510
I'm going to give thanks, too.

00:20:25.810 --> 00:20:26.810
I'll go, too!

00:20:26.810 --> 00:20:27.970
Me, too!

00:20:29.930 --> 00:20:31.310
You're going now?

00:20:42.860 --> 00:20:44.320
Magnificent!

00:20:44.870 --> 00:20:46.700
Terrific!

00:20:46.950 --> 00:20:48.580
Tama-terrific!

00:20:48.950 --> 00:20:50.080
I'm here!

00:21:03.340 --> 00:21:07.600
It's like the fireworks are celebrating
our summer vacation!

00:21:08.470 --> 00:21:09.350
Yeah.

00:21:09.890 --> 00:21:12.270
Because summer vacation's just started!

00:21:12.520 --> 00:21:15.690
There's a lot more fun ahead!

00:21:24.110 --> 00:21:26.030
<i>You're happy
you went out of your way, right?</i>

00:21:28.120 --> 00:21:30.450
<i>Yeah. I'm happy!</i>

00:21:30.750 --> 00:21:32.790
<i>I'm happy I went out of my way!</i>

00:21:33.710 --> 00:21:35.330
KING SNAKE

00:21:34.000 --> 00:21:35.330
We can't just stand here!

00:21:35.710 --> 00:21:37.340
Let's fight back!

00:21:39.670 --> 00:21:43.550
K-Kamuri? Why do you have
all those skyrockets?

00:21:44.720 --> 00:21:47.550
Let's launch some huge fireworks.

00:21:47.800 --> 00:21:50.100
I have a feeling
you'd go flying though, Kamu.

00:21:59.860 --> 00:22:01.530
Say, Kamuri...

00:22:03.150 --> 00:22:05.200
Is this a huge firework?

00:22:05.450 --> 00:22:06.410
Yep, yep!
